"Disconnect the camera, jumper the **SBL** and **3.3V** pins, and reconnect. "
"The chip enumerates in SDP ROM mode (``0x1FC9:0x0135``)."
msgstr ""
"Odspojite kameru, premostite pinove **SBL** i **3.3V**\\ , te ponovno "
"spojite. Čip se prijavljuje u SDP ROM načinu (\\ ``0x1FC9:0x0135``\\ )."

